{"ID":"20240118145009-emh4tx5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145009-emh4tx5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145009-emh4tx5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145009-wrxryal\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162748-x73ttyw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162748-x73ttyw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:328,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:328\u0026#125;","title":"340水蛭","type":"doc","updated":"20240204150950"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145009-wrxryal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145009-wrxryal","updated":"20240122162709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸平，有毒。主逐恶血，瘀血，月闭，破血瘕，积聚，无子，利水道。生池泽。一名至掌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162712-2ifu760","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162712-2ifu760"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产池泽中，处处有之，好吸附人畜肌肤而吮其血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162714-cr4ym63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162714-cr4ym63"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性平，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162715-783p2e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162715-783p2e7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】水蛭主逐恶血，破征积，治折伤坠扑，蓄血疼痛，堕胎通经，外治肿毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162717-t784jj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162717-t784jj5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】堕胎。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162718-fy7ssxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162718-fy7ssxn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药征】治女子月闭，欲成干血劳。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162720-scltufc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162720-scltufc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】痈肿毒肿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162721-au52ujd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162721-au52ujd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】治折伤坠蹼蓄血有功。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162722-5ye1mnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162722-5ye1mnx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】锐而善入，又能允血，故主攻血积。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162724-kn12r8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162724-kn12r8u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】逐瘀破积。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162725-drlsg3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162725-drlsg3m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162726-mrr8i6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162726-mrr8i6x","updated":"20240204150829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】破血泄结之品，不可轻服，误吞水蛭，入腹难死，久则生子，食人肝血，腹痛难忍，面目黄瘦，用田中泥一两，雄黄二钱为丸，分四服，开水下，即随大便而出，桂圆肉包烟油吞之，即下，此物畏石灰食盐。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162709-bj4w7is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162709-bj4w7is"}},{"ID":"20240122162728-ku0g9pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162728-ku0g9pa"}},{"ID":"20240122162728-cjrf7ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162728-cjrf7ar","updated":"20240204150440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在讲的都是一些虫子类的药，很峻，都是毒药。这个340，就是水蛭。经方里面张仲景用水蛭跟牤虫配合在一起用，那这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水蛭必须要找吸血的水蛭"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那水蛭很小，那你只好把脚放到水里面去看它吸到你的脚上的一只，那个就有用。水蛭攻坚的力量非常的强，硬块，活血，化瘀，尤其是急性的，如果有人踢到睾丸，急性的伤，踢到睾丸会重伤，那时候淤血会大块，整个肿起来，小便排不出来，这会死人的，这个时候呢，我们用水蛭用虻虫。那到市场上去"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"挑水蛭的时候，越细小的力量越大"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。很咸味的，味咸都能软坚，你看它逐恶血，淤血。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162737-u2srui4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162737-u2srui4","updated":"20240204150539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方的时候，我们过去经方里面有叫抵当汤，那水蛭和牤虫，在开这种药的时候峻剂，这种都属于峻剂，你可以一剂。一剂给他，就清出来了，大便出来都是黑的，小便那边的淤血都会排出来。一般来说的话，我们开的一钱两钱就够了，看严重性、体格大小。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162738-jbiuvvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162738-jbiuvvj","updated":"20240204150610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水蛭到手上的时候是炮制过，所谓炮制过就是他当场抓到水蛭就在那烧红的瓦片上烧过，偏黄的烤黄了以后，跟牤虫一样烤黄了以后收起来，这样不会坏掉，风干了跟干掉了一样，只要没有水它就不会坏掉，那就不需要再做其他的炮制了。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162745-xaejm9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162745-xaejm9g","updated":"20240204150633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药征】你看看，治女子月经，月经都不来了，月闭，干血在里面，你用很多活血化瘀的药清不出来的时候，诸位就要想到用动物性的药，一剂就够了，吃了月经就来了，那[别录]：堕胎，下胎，那宗奭呢治折伤，跌扑，再有讲的就是睾丸那边阴部那边。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162748-x73ttyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162748-x73ttyw","updated":"20240204150950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个诸位看禁忌有没有，如果说你误吞，这个不小心吞下去了，这个是很危险的，会爬到肝脏上面去，那你如何去解它呢，诸位看这个田里面的泥巴跟雄黄有没有，或者说这个桂圆包，桂圆的肉跟烟的油包在一起。为什么会这样子，因为这种中医，比如说过去我们解毒，比如说阴阳水，什麼叫阴阳水，就是你到井里面去拿一碗水，到河里面去拿一碗水，井的水没有见过太阳，河的水每天太阳晒，反正都很脏吗，不同的脏混在一起，阴阳水解毒，一吃下去当场上吐下泻就解掉了嘛，泥巴水你说脏不脏，让你喝那个就是让你解毒，把那个吐掉的意思，吐下。那这个水蛭，如果真的不小心吃进去，前面有症状，现在那还是会发生，有那个小朋友到那个山里面去河里面去游泳，那个水蛭跑到鼻子里面去，堵在里面啊，清除水蛭的方式，诸位看看这个。"}]}]}